15. expiresAt not valid ISO 8601 — 400
========================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 175

{
  "detail": "'expiresAt' is not a valid ISO 8601 DateTime",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid DateTime",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



16. q not a string — 400
==========================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 155

{
  "detail": "'q' must be a string",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Subscription",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



17. geoQ missing geometry — 400
=================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 213

{
  "detail": "'geoQ' requires 'geometry', 'coordinates', and 'georel' — missing 'geometry'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Subscription",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



18. geoQ invalid geometry value — 400
=======================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 178

{
  "detail": "'geoQ.geometry' has invalid value 'Hexagon'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Subscription",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



19. Duplicate entities field — 400
====================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 175

{
  "detail": "Duplicate member 'entities' in a JSON object",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Duplicate Member",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



20. status is read-only — 400
===============================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 169

{
  "detail": "'status' is read-only and cannot be set",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Read-Only Field",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



21. PATCH with id — 400
=========================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/subscriptions/urn:ngsi-ld:Subscription:Err
Content-Length: 0


HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 153

{
  "detail": "'id' cannot be modified",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Read-Only Field",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



22. PATCH with type — 400
===========================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 155

{
  "detail": "'type' cannot be modified",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Read-Only Field",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



23. Valid creation — 201 (sanity check)
=========================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/subscriptions/urn:ngsi-ld:Subscription:OK
Content-Length: 0




24. q syntactically invalid (unbalanced paren) — 400
======================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 161

{
  "detail": "missing ')' in q expression",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid q parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



25. csourceSubscription with syntactically invalid q — 400
============================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 161

{
  "detail": "missing ')' in q expression",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid q parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



26. bare attribute path is a VALID q (existence predicate, § 4.9) — 201
==========================================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/subscriptions/urn:ngsi-ld:Subscription:bareQ
Content-Length: 0




--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
